    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76471" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παγκρᾰτ-ιάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>perform the exercises of the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παγκράτιον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				15.252
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				456d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chrm.</u>
				159c
			</span></i>, etc.: c. acc. cogn., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντας ἐπαγκρατίασε τοὺς κλήρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					1073.28
				</span></i>
			 (Olympia, <span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>): metaph., of gesticulation,
				<i>sway one's arms about like a gymnast</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ ἐκκλησίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.26
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				33
			</span></i>.</div>
